Oh! &nbsp;I get it!

&nbsp;

It never quite made sense to me that the spirits gain elements by using powers. &nbsp;But now I&#39;m starting to see how much the spirits are defined by the powers they are using. &nbsp;The powers don&#39;t represent the spirits [i]doing[/i] specific things, they represent the spirits [i]becoming[/i] those things, at least partially.
